    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Equation of parabola&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math>,</p><p>Also the general equation of a parabola is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>On comparing, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Tangent on parabola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0046_14a794da29e2.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 275px;\" /></p><p>Now using the midpoint formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now, eliminating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;The locus of its circumcentre is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
